Subject: [PATCH 25/29] debian: version for the Galaxy S10+ port

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 debian/changelog | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index daa5ad4f..79e463aa 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,17 @@
+plasma-mobile-wf (6.5.2-1~git20251121171019.91ba13c.next.plasma.6.5+s10plus14) rolling; urgency=medium
+
+  * Quick settings handle: hold and drag down to expand (One UI), the card
+    follows the finger; a tap no longer expands it.
+  * Folio: widgets can be dragged onto the home screen again.
+  * Task switcher in the shell over the wayfire IPC (the scale plugin
+    crashes in the Mali driver): Android-like card stack with One UI look,
+    window thumbnails from the podglad wayfire plugin, close and close all.
+  * Status bar and navigation panel: the colour of a launched app is
+    cleared on any focus change; under wayfire the tasks model has no
+    windows, so it used to stay on the bar after going home.
+
+ -- Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 14:30:00 +0000
+
 plasma-mobile-wf (6.5.2-1~git20251121171019.91ba13c.next.plasma.6.5+s10plus13) rolling; urgency=medium
 
